{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Z6UYstZ0ge1794309635.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本自衛隊隊員強闖中國駐日本大使館案，當地檢方建議判處18個月監禁。</p><p></p><p>共同社報道，被告24歲陸上自衛隊前三等陸尉村田晃大，涉嫌於今年3月24日，帶刀翻牆闖入中國駐日大使館，威脅殺害中方外交人員，隨後被警方拘捕，並被陸上自衛隊免職。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.TRIAL-1830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CLit324HIZ1794309666.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>他否認威脅使館工作人員，只承認闖入建築物，以及違反《槍刀法》的罪名。檢方要求將他判監一年半，辯方則要求判處罰款，法院將於12月24日作出判決。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.548908+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T09:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T17:58:20.700783+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:13.147255+00:00","content_hash":"99fa818a9dc593e302a07e57abe1fe9c2b819150b32586f464e3fb73d5c4e94e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}